 ## Background
-A-NeRF was introduced in "A-NeRF: Articulated Neural Radiance Fields for Learning Human Shape, Appearance, and Pose" [S1, unofficial]. It builds on the principles of NeRF by incorporating articulated human motion. The skeleton representation is equivalent to SMPL joints but removes the parametric surface model, providing a more flexible prior for pose estimation [S1, unofficial].
